  "description": "Ready-made Windows Forms upload dialog and control for large files: LargeFileUploaderForm.Show(this, options) or a LargeFileUploaderControl from the Toolbox. Drag & drop, multi-file queue, chunked uploads to Azure Blob Storage through a LargeFileUploader server, with retries, resume, and a progress bar and cancel button per file. High-DPI aware. .NET Framework 4.6.2+ and .NET 8+.",
